{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4001_039kon", "source_sha256": "58eccf9c4499c30f387e6f2872de10a5aac2fede4cec9ad3e5eb1f69ff9367a1", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}？\n今さらだけど……。", "zh": "我说，{$P$}？\n虽然现在才说这个有点迟了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4002_039kon", "source_sha256": "38805759677093d6aadf6045739173eaaaff4b5d7dfb5088dd47a0b494b26249", "ja": "この仕事……私じゃなくても、\nもっと向いてる子がいたわよね？", "zh": "这份工作……就算不找我，\n也应该有更适合的人选吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4003_p", "source_sha256": "bc1e74167c0bf525202b1958d0fce9b994dcffa42d156c86b3f9f91a633c6e40", "ja": "アイドル対抗バレー大会……\n気が進みませんか？　このみさん。", "zh": "偶像对抗排球大赛……\n提不起劲吗？木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4004_039kon", "source_sha256": "8b49cea1ffd447854076a80d4958ee77c7e0e6ed9c835bfd4a503e60b487aea1", "ja": "そんなの、見ればわかるでしょ！　いくら私が\n大人の魅力にあふれてるとはいっても、その……。", "zh": "这一看就知道了吧！\n就算我再怎么充满成人魅力，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4005_039kon", "source_sha256": "c711fdac61622fe96bcbad91b7d9fce06c1dd269f29855db4134610ad56059a8", "ja": "私……し、身長、高くないし……。", "zh": "我……身、身高又不高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4006_039kon", "source_sha256": "a27b64cfab0ceadf0e4353d94d9d4c711f17832445e43cfa0640fc882d06057e", "ja": "そりゃやるからには、もちろん頑張るわよ？　でも、\n他の子の足を引っぱっちゃわないかしらって……。", "zh": "既然都决定要做，我当然是会加油啦。但是，\n我担心自己会不会扯了其他人的后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4007_p", "source_sha256": "cd39bfa5a534fb9ea4a5ee21e3bbd1103adea1657a1d4e4298986cd088eef1e0", "ja": "そのことですか。安心してください、このみさん。\n俺に考えがあります。", "zh": "原来是这么一回事啊，请你安心吧，木实，\n我自有想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4008", "source_sha256": "88f5b8bc1b26a9ce3ded2cb5632e3f529955b598443e89747be3f2af98abe6b9", "ja": "頭を使う", "zh": "用头脑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
