{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4010", "source_sha256": "6283178ec6f711272f9f0250698d91c6751e92f3b500379a204e827b7b4f2ba6", "ja": "合体変形！", "zh": "合体变形！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4100_p", "source_sha256": "586ddb4dc9666c3cbb9bc5783db03d7aa677428a30f34e6ab1c3dd203f92481a", "ja": "このみさんは、頭を使う……。つまり、\n司令塔として作戦を立てるんです。", "zh": "木实要用头脑……也就是说，\n要负责发号施令，拟定作战计划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4101_039kon", "source_sha256": "7dfe02235c462ae2b313536c2c88f6b4674b1677efa75aba56eb5cff300e3abd", "ja": "なるほど……！　それなら、\n私のオトナの経験値を生かせるわね！", "zh": "原来如此……！这么一来\n就能活用我的成人经验值了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
