{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4200_p", "source_sha256": "45abcd54025605e73cadb45752e56a225a085113d7bf6e20f6f469bfea05bad3", "ja": "このみさんの大人の魅力で、\n相手を圧倒してしまえばいいんですよ！", "zh": "只要用木实的成人魅力\n压制对手就可以了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4201_039kon", "source_sha256": "59ecd4192fcd289a4b7459b5028fcb870f24da15cccbd9b69c4edebc2efc872b", "ja": "か、完璧な作戦だわ……！\nやるじゃない、{$P$}！", "zh": "真、真是完美的作战计划……！\n你还不错嘛，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4202_039kon", "source_sha256": "950404930b0fac67a560bea9a89bc59a53b195e6b41bf9146fba6b75e5209b38", "ja": "って、対戦相手は女の子じゃないの！　くっ、これが\n男の子だったら、こっちの勝ちは確実だったのに……！", "zh": "等等，比赛对手不是女孩子吗！呜，要是对手\n是男生的话，我们就胜券在握了说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4300_p", "source_sha256": "dc560bfb7fdc98fba4b5f906566b9e0f4cf57b6ba060c7b6a3aa7adf065a9dc3", "ja": "チームメイトに肩車してもらって、\n戦うんですよ！　これなら……。", "zh": "就骑在队友肩上战斗吧！\n这样一来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4301_039kon", "source_sha256": "46783acc75d1440f580e1d79594f9d278ff741a295b81bcfe1df96c0d23cda6b", "ja": "そんなの、認められるわけないでしょ！\n適当なこと言わないのっ！", "zh": "这制作单位怎么可能同意呀！\n你不要随便乱讲话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_039kon_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_039kon_4302_039kon", "source_sha256": "12edf738840a4c66da55c14493dceefba591c8c8cbf9fa17ddcfd1dcfbb87366", "ja": "なによ、私の背が、ほんのちょっと\n低いからって、子ども扱いして……！", "zh": "什么嘛，只因为我的身高矮了一点点，\n就把我当小孩子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
